{"4524460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Redline JDM Drift", "steam_appid": 4524460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legendary Cars, Pure Drift</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide range of drift cars and push each one to the limit. Earn money, unlock new vehicles, and build your garage on the road to becoming the next Drift King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/7733ed2a1aa363d3d0228328ed58c2f9.poster.avif?t=1782277370\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/7733ed2a1aa363d3d0228328ed58c2f9.webm?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/7733ed2a1aa363d3d0228328ed58c2f9.mp4?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer Action</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump online and drift with other players anytime. Cruise through the city, chase high scores, show off your skills, and react with emotes during the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/2266f7488e0f549ec2fe457b844d0d37.poster.avif?t=1782277370\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/2266f7488e0f549ec2fe457b844d0d37.webm?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/2266f7488e0f549ec2fe457b844d0d37.mp4?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Physics and Handling</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy smooth controls, responsive handling, and drift physics designed to feel fun from the very first turn. Chain long drifts, hold clean lines, and keep your momentum alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/0bc14a356e40adfde85becf1fa4f0431.poster.avif?t=1782277370\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/0bc14a356e40adfde85becf1fa4f0431.webm?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/0bc14a356e40adfde85becf1fa4f0431.mp4?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful Visuals, Smooth Performance</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through a vibrant world with polished graphics, strong atmosphere, and clean car presentation. The game is built to look great and run smoothly while keeping the action fast and enjoyable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/9045480daff8ac8674a23fa629173cc1.poster.avif?t=1782277370\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/9045480daff8ac8674a23fa629173cc1.webm?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/9045480daff8ac8674a23fa629173cc1.mp4?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression That Rewards Style</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift to earn money, unlock more content, raise your level, and expand your collection. The more you drive, the more opportunities you unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/12c6d6b2bdec98045ff2389ec4182083.poster.avif?t=1782277370\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/12c6d6b2bdec98045ff2389ec4182083.webm?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/12c6d6b2bdec98045ff2389ec4182083.mp4?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legendary Cars, Pure Drift</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide range of drift cars and push each one to the limit. Earn money, unlock new vehicles, and build your garage on the road to becoming the next Drift King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/7733ed2a1aa363d3d0228328ed58c2f9.poster.avif?t=1782277370\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/7733ed2a1aa363d3d0228328ed58c2f9.webm?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/7733ed2a1aa363d3d0228328ed58c2f9.mp4?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer Action</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump online and drift with other players anytime. Cruise through the city, chase high scores, show off your skills, and react with emotes during the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/2266f7488e0f549ec2fe457b844d0d37.poster.avif?t=1782277370\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/2266f7488e0f549ec2fe457b844d0d37.webm?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/2266f7488e0f549ec2fe457b844d0d37.mp4?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Physics and Handling</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy smooth controls, responsive handling, and drift physics designed to feel fun from the very first turn. Chain long drifts, hold clean lines, and keep your momentum alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/0bc14a356e40adfde85becf1fa4f0431.poster.avif?t=1782277370\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/0bc14a356e40adfde85becf1fa4f0431.webm?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/0bc14a356e40adfde85becf1fa4f0431.mp4?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful Visuals, Smooth Performance</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through a vibrant world with polished graphics, strong atmosphere, and clean car presentation. The game is built to look great and run smoothly while keeping the action fast and enjoyable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/9045480daff8ac8674a23fa629173cc1.poster.avif?t=1782277370\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/9045480daff8ac8674a23fa629173cc1.webm?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/9045480daff8ac8674a23fa629173cc1.mp4?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression That Rewards Style</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift to earn money, unlock more content, raise your level, and expand your collection. The more you drive, the more opportunities you unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/12c6d6b2bdec98045ff2389ec4182083.poster.avif?t=1782277370\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/12c6d6b2bdec98045ff2389ec4182083.webm?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524460/extras/12c6d6b2bdec98045ff2389ec4182083.mp4?t=1782277370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_descriptio